  message: "Fixed in PR (jgstern-agent/docs/limits-max-tier-applied). limits.max_tier_applied is now documented in docs/hypergumbo-spec.md, in the section-9 limits block right after partial_results_reason: it records the supply-chain tier ceiling in effect when a --max-tier N filter was applied (null/absent when unfiltered), cross-referencing section 14 (tier definitions) and section 3 (the flag). EVIDENCE: grep -c max_tier_applied docs/hypergumbo-spec.md -> 1 (was 0). Schema already carried it (docs/schema.json max_tier_applied, description 'Max supply-chain tier filter applied, when any')."  # cb67
